i3 Keybindings
==============

$mod = Super/Windows key

HELP
  $mod+Shift+?          keybinding helper (rofi)

TERMINAL & APPS
  $mod+Return           terminal (kitty)
  $mod+Shift+Return     terminal (konsole)
  Ctrl+$alt+t           terminal (kitty, alt)
  $mod+space            application launcher (rofi)
  $mod+d                dmenu desktop launcher
  $mod+tab              window switcher (rofi)
  $alt+space            application launcher (rofi)
  $mod+z                categorized menu (morc_menu)
  $mod+F1               dolphin (file manager)
  $mod+Shift+F1         dolphin as root (pkexec)
  $mod+F2               brave
  $mod+Shift+F2         brave (incognito)
  $mod+F3               Gmail
  $mod+F9               toggle opencode (tmux session)
  $mod+F10              toggle kilo (tmux session)
  $mod+F11              monitor (tmux session)
  $mod+F12              toggle yaquake
  $mod+grave            toggle work (tmux session)

WINDOW MANAGEMENT
  $mod+h/j/k/l          focus left/down/up/right
  $mod+Shift+h/j/k/l    move window left/down/up/right
  $mod+q                kill focused window (graceful close)
  $mod+Ctrl+q           xkill (click to kill)
  $mod+f                fullscreen toggle
  $mod+Shift+f          global fullscreen toggle
  $mod+space            application launcher (rofi)
  $mod+d                dmenu desktop launcher
  $mod+t                floating toggle (tiling ↔ floating)  
  $mod+bar              split horizontal
  $mod+underscore       split vertical
  $mod+s                toggle split orientation (splith|splitv)
  $mod+Shift+s          sticky toggle
  $mod+x                layout toggle (splith/tabbed)  
  $mod+r                enter resize mode
  $mod+BackSpace        show scratchpad
  $mod+Shift+BackSpace  move to scratchpad
  $mod+a                parent/child focus toggle

SYSTEM
  $mod+0                system menu (lock/exit/suspend/reboot/shutdown)
  $mod+9                lock screen
  $mod+Shift+p          power profiles menu  
  $mod+Ctrl+p           toggle picom (on/off)
  $mod+Shift+c          reload i3 config
  $mod+Shift+r          restart i3

WORKSPACES (per-monitor, niri-style via i3-multimonitor)
  Each monitor has its own 1-8: left = 1a-8a (HDMI-A-1), right = 1b-8b
  (DisplayPort-3). Keys are handled by the i3-multimonitor daemon and map to
  the focused monitor's workspace set.
  $mod+1-8              switch to workspace N on focused monitor
  $mod+Shift+1-8        move focused window to workspace N and switch
  $mod+Ctrl+1-8         move focused window to workspace N (stay on current)
  $mod+Ctrl+Right       next workspace on focused monitor
  $mod+Ctrl+Left        previous workspace on focused monitor
  $mod+b                workspace back_and_forth
  $mod+Shift+b          move container to back_and_forth
  $mod+$alt+Right       next workspace
  $mod+$alt+Left        previous workspace

APPEARANCE
  $mod+y                border toggle (none → pixel 1 → normal)
  $mod+Shift+g          adjust gaps

MULTIMEDIA
  XF86AudioRaiseVolume  volume up (+5%)
  XF86AudioLowerVolume  volume down (-5%)
  XF86AudioMute         mute toggle
  XF86AudioMicMute      mic mute toggle
  XF86AudioPrev         previous track
  XF86AudioPlay         play/pause
  XF86AudioNext         next track
  $mod+Ctrl+m           audio mixer (pavucontrol)
  $mod+p                cycle audio output (speakers/headset)

BRIGHTNESS
  XF86MonBrightnessUp   brightness up
  XF86MonBrightnessDown brightness down

SCREENSHOTS
  Print                 full screenshot
  $mod+Print            window screenshot
  $mod+Shift+Print      selection screenshot
